<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bn">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no" />
    <title>সেবা বাজার</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css" />
    <link href="https://unpkg.com/maplibre-gl@4.7.0/dist/maplibre-gl.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/maplibre-gl@4.7.0/dist/maplibre-gl.js"></script>
    <script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.7.1/firebase-app-compat.js"></script>
    <script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.7.1/firebase-auth-compat.js"></script>
    <script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.7.1/firebase-firestore-compat.js"></script>
    <style>
        *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,system-ui,sans-serif}
        body{background:#1a1a1a;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden}#app-wrapper{width:100%;height:100vh;background:#fef9e7;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
        #status-bar{background:#1e1e1e;color:#fff;padding:6px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:600;flex-shrink:0;min-height:30px;z-index:100}
        #app-content{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 16px;background:#fef9e7}
        .page{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;padding-bottom:12px;animation:fadeUp .25s ease}.page.active{display:flex}
        @keyframes fadeUp{0%{opacity:.6;transform:translateY(10px)}100%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
        #page-onboarding{display:none;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:70vh;text-align:center;padding:20px;gap:20px}
        #page-onboarding.active{display:flex}
        #page-onboarding .logo{font-size:4.5rem;background:#f7c948;width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:30px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(247,201,72,.3)}
        #page-onboarding .app-name{font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:800;color:#1e1e1e}
        #page-onboarding .loading-dots{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:10px}
        #page-onboarding .loading-dots span{width:12px;height:12px;background:#f7c948;border-radius:50%;animation:bounce 1.2s ease-in-out infinite}
        #page-onboarding .loading-dots span:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.2s}
        #page-onboarding .loading-dots span:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.4s}
        @keyframes bounce{0%,80%,100%{transform:scale(.6);opacity:.4}40%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1}}
        #page-role{justify-content:center;min-height:70vh;gap:20px}
        .role-btn{background:#fff;border:2px solid #f7c948;border-radius:60px;padding:22px 10px;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;color:#1e1e1e;box-shadow:0 6px 0 #e6b13a;transition:.08s linear;cursor:pointer;text-align:center;width:100%;max-width:320px;margin:0 auto}
        .role-btn:active{transform:translateY(5px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 #e6b13a}
        .role-btn i{margin-right:12px;color:#dba32b}
        .role-btn span{display:block;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:500;color:#5e5a4a;margin-top:2px}
        .yellow-btn{background:#f7c948;border:none;padding:14px 12px;border-radius:60px;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;color:#1e1e1e;box-shadow:0 5px 0 #dba32b;cursor:pointer;text-align:center;width:100%}
        .yellow-btn:active{transform:translateY(4px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 #dba32b}
        .input-group{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
        .input-group label{font-weight:600;color:#2d2a1e;font-size:.85rem}
        .input-group input{padding:14px 18px;border-radius:40px;border:1.5px solid #f0e3c0;background:#fefcf5;font-size:1rem;outline:none;width:100%}
        .input-group input:focus{border-color:#f5b342;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(245,179,66,.15)}
        .back-link{color:#b89b4b;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:none;background:transparent;font-size:.95rem;padding:4px 0;width:fit-content}
        .app-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding-bottom:2px}
        .app-header h2{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:#1e1e1e}
        .subhead{color:#5e5a4a;font-size:.9rem;border-left:4px solid #f5b342;padding-left:12px;background:#fff9e6;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:6px 12px;margin-top:-6px}
        .text-center{text-align:center}.text-muted{color:#7a725a;font-size:.8rem}
        #bottom-nav-user,#bottom-nav-provider{background:#fff;border-top:2px solid #f7e9b0;padding:6px 12px 10px;display:none;justify-content:space-around;align-items:center;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:auto}
        #bottom-nav-user.show,#bottom-nav-provider.show{display:flex}
        .nav-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;color:#a0967a;font-size:.6rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:40px;border:none;background:transparent;gap:1px;min-width:50px}
        .nav-item i{font-size:1.3rem}
        .nav-item.active{color:#dba32b;background:#fef6dc;padding:4px 14px}
        .dash-card{background:#fefcf5;border-radius:20px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #f7e3a0;box-shadow:0 4px 0 #efe1b0}
        .toast{position:fixed;bottom:80px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#1e1e1e;color:#fff;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:40px;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;z-index:9999;display:none;max-width:90%;text-align:center}
        .toast.show{display:block;animation:fadeUp .3s ease}
        .toast.success{background:#2e7d32}
        .toast.error{background:#c62828}
        .toast.warning{background:#e65100}
        .otp-status{text-align:center;font-weight:600;margin-top:4px;font-size:.9rem}
        .otp-status.success{color:#2e7d32}
        .otp-status.error{color:#c62828}
        .otp-row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
        .otp-row input{flex:2;text-align:center;font-size:1.2rem;letter-spacing:4px}
        .otp-row .yellow-btn{flex:1;padding:14px 6px;font-size:.9rem;width:auto}
        .category-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}
        .category-item{background:#fefcf5;border:1.5px solid #f7e3a0;border-radius:40px;padding:12px 6px;text-align:center;font-weight:600;color:#2d2a1e;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #e6d19c;cursor:pointer;font-size:.8rem}
        .category-item i{display:block;font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:2px;color:#dba32b}
        .offer-banner{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f7d44a,#f5b342);border-radius:24px;padding:18px 16px;color:#1e1e1e;box-shadow:0 5px 0 #dba32b}
        .offer-banner h3{font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:800}
        .offer-banner p{font-weight:500;opacity:.85;margin-top:2px}
        .search-bar{background:#fefcf5;border:2px solid #f7e3a0;border-radius:60px;padding:10px 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
        .search-bar i{color:#b89b4b;font-size:1.1rem}
        .search-bar input{border:none;background:transparent;font-size:1rem;width:100%;outline:none}
        .wallet-box{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f7c948,#f5b342);border-radius:24px;color:#1e1e1e}
        .wallet-box .amount{font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:800}
        .wallet-box .label{font-size:.85rem;opacity:.8}
        .wallet-transaction{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f7e9b0}
        .wallet-transaction .amount.credit{color:#2e7d32}
        .wallet-transaction .amount.debit{color:#c62828}
        .commission-info{background:#fff9e6;border-radius:16px;padding:10px 14px;border-left:4px solid #f5b342;font-size:.85rem;color:#5e5a4a}
        .admin-lock{text-align:center;padding:10px 0}
        .admin-lock input{padding:14px 18px;border-radius:40px;border:1.5px solid #f0e3c0;background:#fefcf5;font-size:1rem;outline:none;width:100%;text-align:center}
        .admin-stats-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
        .admin-stat-card{background:#fefcf5;border-radius:16px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #f7e3a0;text-align:center}
        .admin-stat-card .number{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:#1e1e1e}
        .admin-stat-card .label{font-size:.7rem;color:#5e5a4a}
        .admin-stat-card i{font-size:1.2rem;color:#f7c948;margin-bottom:2px}
        .admin-user-item{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f7e9b0}
        .admin-user-item .info{font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem}
        .admin-actions{display:flex;gap:6px}
        .admin-actions button{background:#f7c948;border:none;border-radius:40px;padding:4px 10px;font-weight:600;font-size:.65rem;cursor:pointer}
        .admin-actions button.danger{background:#e53935;color:#fff}
        .filter-row{display:flex;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto;padding:4px 0}
        .filter-row button{padding:6px 14px;border-radius:40px;border:1.5px solid #f0e3c0;background:#fefcf5;font-weight:600;font-size:.7rem;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
        .filter-row button.active{background:#f7c948;border-color:#f7c948;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #dba32b}
        #mapContainer{height:180px;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;border:2px solid #f7e3a0;background:#e8e4d8}
        .map-loading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%;color:#5e5a4a;background:#fefcf5;font-size:.8rem;gap:8px}
        .map-loading i{color:#f7c948;animation:spin 1s linear infinite}
        @keyframes spin{100%{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
        .location-input-row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
        .location-input-row input{flex:1;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:40px;border:1.5px solid #f0e3c0;background:#fefcf5;font-size:.9rem;outline:none}
        .location-input-row button{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:40px;border:none;background:#f7c948;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #dba32b;white-space:nowrap;font-size:.8rem}
        .map-location-text{margin-top:4px;text-align:center;font-size:.7rem;color:#5e5a4a}
        .provider-card{background:#fefcf5;border-radius:18px;padding:14px;border:1px solid #f7e3a0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
        .provider-card .avatar{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.2rem;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0}
        .provider-card .info{flex:1}
        .provider-card .info .name{font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem}
        .provider-card .info .detail{font-size:.7rem;color:#5e5a4a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
        .badge-distance{background:#f0e3c0;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:40px;font-size:.6rem;font-weight:600}
        .contact-buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
        .contact-buttons a{flex:1;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:40px;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:.65rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;min-width:50px}
        .btn-whatsapp{background:#25D366;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #128C7E}
        .btn-imo{background:#1A8BFF;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #0A5EB0}
        .btn-phone-call{background:#4CAF50;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #2e7d32;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:40px;border:none;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:.85rem}
        .btn-book{background:#f7c948;color:#1e1e1e;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #dba32b;border:none;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:40px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;font-size:.75rem}
        .btn-accept{background:#4CAF50;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #2e7d32;border:none;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:40px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;font-size:.75rem}
        .btn-reject{background:#e53935;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #b71c1c;border:none;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:40px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;font-size:.75rem}
        .order-card{background:#fefcf5;border-radius:18px;padding:14px;border:1px solid #f7e3a0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
        .status-badge{padding:4px 12px;border-radius:40px;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700}
        .status-badge.pending{background:#ffd54f}
        .status-badge.ongoing{background:#4FC3F7}
        .status-badge.completed{background:#81C784;color:#1e1e1e}
        .status-badge.cancelled{background:#e57373;color:#fff}
        .booking-request{background:#fefcf5;border-radius:18px;padding:14px;border:1px solid #f7e3a0;border-left:4px solid #f7c948}
        .booking-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}
        .loading-spinner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:20px;color:#5e5a4a}
        .loading-spinner i{color:#f7c948;font-size:1.5rem;animation:spin 1s linear infinite}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="app-wrapper">
<div id="status-bar"><span class="time">9:41</span><span class="icons"><i class="fas fa-signal"></i><i class="fas fa-wifi"></i><i class="fas fa-battery-three-quarters"></i></span></div>
<div id="toast" class="toast"></div>
<div id="app-content">
<div id="page-onboarding" class="page active"><div style="flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:20px;min-height:60vh;"><div class="logo"><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i></div><div><div class="app-name" id="appNameDisplay">সেবা বাজার</div><div class="app-tagline">পেশাদার সেবা এক ক্লিকে</div></div><div class="loading-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div style="font-size:.8rem;color:#b89b4b;margin-top:10px;"><i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> লোড হচ্ছে...</div></div></div>
<div id="page-role" class="page"><div class="app-header" style="justify-content:center;text-align:center;"><h2>👋 স্বাগতম</h2></div><div class="subhead" style="text-align:center;border-left:none;background:transparent;padding:0;">আপনি কি হিসেবে যুক্ত হবেন?</div><div class="role-btn" onclick="selectRole('user')"><i class="fas fa-user"></i> ইউজার <span>সেবা নিতে চাই</span></div><div class="role-btn" onclick="selectRole('provider')"><i class="fas fa-tools"></i> প্রোভাইডার <span>সেবা দিতে চাই</span></div><div class="text-center text-muted" style="margin-top:16px;"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> নিরাপদ & বিশ্বস্ত</div></div>
<div id="page-user-form" class="page"><button class="back-link" onclick="goToPage('page-role')"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> পিছনে</button><div class="app-header"><h2>📝 আপনার তথ্য</h2></div><div class="subhead">ইউজার হিসেবে নিবন্ধন</div><div class="input-group"><label><i class="fas fa-user"></i> আপনার নাম</label><input type="text" id="user-name" placeholder="আপনার নাম"></div><div class="input-group"><label><i class="fas fa-map-pin"></i> লোকেশন</label><input type="text" id="user-location" placeholder="ঢাকা, মিরপুর"></div><div class="input-group"><label><i class="fas fa-phone-alt"></i> মোবাইল নম্বর</label><input type="tel" id="user-phone" placeholder="০১XXXXXXXXX"></div><button class="yellow-btn" onclick="registerUser()"><i class="fas fa-user-plus"></i> নিবন্ধন করুন</button><div class="text-center text-muted" style="font-size:.8rem;">ইতিমধ্যে অ্যাকাউন্ট আছে? <span style="color:#f7c948;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;" onclick="showUserLogin()">লগইন করুন</span></div></div>
<div id="page-user-login" class="page"><button class="back-link" onclick="goToPage('page-role')"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> পিছনে</button><div class="app-header"><h2>🔑 লগইন</h2></div><div class="subhead">ইউজার হিসেবে লগইন</div><div class="input-group"><label><i class="fas fa-phone-alt"></i> মোবাইল নম্বর</label><input type="tel" id="user-login-phone" placeholder="০১XXXXXXXXX"></div><button class="yellow-btn" onclick="loginUser()"><i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt"></i> লগইন করুন</button><div class="text-center text-muted" style="font-size:.8rem;">নতুন? <span style="color:#f7c948;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;" onclick="showUserRegister()">নিবন্ধন করুন</span></div></div>
<div id="page-user-home" class="page"><div class="app-header"><h2>🏠 হোম</h2><span class="badge"><i class="fas fa-bell"></i></span></div><div class="search-bar"><i class="fas fa-search"></i><input type="text" placeholder="কী সার্ভিস খুঁজছেন?" id="userSearchInput"></div><div class="offer-banner"><h3>🔥 আজকের অফার</h3><p>সকল সার্ভিসে ২০% ডিসকাউন্ট! <span style="background:#1e1e1e;color:#fff;padding:2px 14px;border-radius:40px;font-size:.75rem;">নতুন ইউজার</span></p><div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;"><span style="background:#ffffff80;padding:2px 12px;border-radius:40px;font-size:.7rem;">প্লাম্বার</span><span style="background:#ffffff80;padding:2px 12px;border-radius:40px;font-size:.7rem;">ইলেকট্রিশিয়ান</span><span style="background:#ffffff80;padding:2px 12px;border-radius:40px;font-size:.7rem;">এসি টেকনিশিয়ান</span></div></div><div class="dash-card" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;"><div><div style="font-size:.75rem;color:#5e5a4a;">ওয়ালেট ব্যালেন্স</div><div style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:800;">৳ <span id="userWalletBalance">০</span></div></div><button class="yellow-btn" style="width:auto;padding:10px 18px;font-size:.85rem;" onclick="goToPage('page-user-wallet')"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i> রিচার্জ</button></div><div class="category-grid"><div class="category-item" onclick="openCategory('প্লাম্বার')"><i class="fas fa-wrench"></i> প্লাম্বার</div><div class="category-item" onclick="openCategory('ইলেকট্রিশিয়ান')"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> ইলেকট্রিশিয়ান</div><div class="category-item" onclick="openCategory('এসি টেকনিশিয়ান')"><i class="fas fa-snowflake"></i> এসি</div><div class="category-item" onclick="openCategory('ক্লিনার')"><i class="fas fa-broom"></i> ক্লিনার</div><div class="category-item" onclick="openCategory('কার্পেন্টার')"><i class="fas fa-hammer"></i> কার্পেন্টার</div><div class="category-item" onclick="openCategory('মেকানিক')"><i class="fas fa-car"></i> মেকানিক</div></div></div>
